'''Change1661 test: the unquoted form on a line that ends with a carriage return (as a CRLF file read on Linux)
'''Expected: compiles, no warning; PORTB = 0x11 (lib1\a_lib1.h). The #option line below ends CR CR LF on purpose. On Windows it passes with or without the CR fix (Windows reads a lone CR as a line end too): it is the check to run on a Linux build.
#chip 16F877A, 20
#option explicit
#option IncludePath lib1
#include <a_lib1.h>

FromLib1
Do
Loop
